  "description": {
   "en": "Mao, an earnest and straightforward man who is passionate about film, and Kotobuki, a beautiful delinquent and loner who is actually gay. The two share a dorm room at an all-boys school, and gradually become good friends and then lovers. This is an extra edition of \"Tasogare Outfocus\" that includes extra editions (part 1, part 2, and part 3) that depict their high school life after they start dating, take.7 that was not included in the \"Twilight Outfocus\" comics, the drama CD recording report manga, \"Koi Iro Soft Focus\", and \"What Shines in the Night Sky\"."
  },
